=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_a3f7 — p_c007 fork: Kitchen tools rest at the sink, pot in the pantry (fork of p_c007)

This fork corrects the single most damaging error in the parent: the kitchen tools do not live on the counter or in the cupboard. The cutting board, pan, spatula, and kitchen knife all rest at the kitchen sink (sink_k1), and the pot lives on the pantry shelf (pantry_shelf_k1). The parent's claims placing the cutting board and pan at counter_k1 during the 18:00–19:30 cooking window accumulated 9 and 11 "against" tallies respectively, and the "blocks that failed" section confirms the cutting board at counter_k1 and the pot at cupboard_k1 were wrong on the majority of sightings. The morning-routine structure (Yuki 06:30–07:30, Omar 07:00–07:45, staggered bathroom use) and the shared-dinner framework are retained, but the tools are now at the sink for their resting state and during the cooking window. The pot is at the pantry shelf, not the cupboard. What would refute this fork: the cutting board or pan sighted at counter_k1 or cupboard_k1 on multiple occasions, or the pot at cupboard_k1.

